---
import NeuronExplorer from "./NeuronExplorer.astro";
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="discipline">Computational neuroscience</p>
      <h1>Mranmay <em>Shetty</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">
        I study how visual circuits encode what we see and how we remember it.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-bio">
        I’ve worked with Federico Rossi on visual cortex, Gabriel Kreiman on
        working memory, and Laurent Perrinet and Bruno Cessac on spike
        inference. With Bruno, I also explored models of the retina.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="button solid" href="/research/">Explore research</a><a
          class="button quiet"
          href="/cv/">View CV</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <NeuronExplorer />
  </div>
</section>
